OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and feeling mild and
OL,6,Fbreezy to start, but some warm spells
OL,7,Fof sunshine breaking through in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Mostly dry except for a
OL,9,Fspot of rain in the north.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FLargely dry with clear spells
OL,12,Fthis evening and into tonight, but
OL,13,Fcloudier in the far north with the odd
OL,14,Fspot of rain. Fog developing under the
OL,15,Fclearest skies.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
