OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA foggy start in places,
OL,6,Flifting through the morning. Mostly
OL,7,Fcloudy with spots of drizzle mixed
OL,8,Fwith bright or sunny intervals. Cooler
OL,9,Fthan previous days but still feeling
OL,10,Frather mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FAn
OL,13,Funsettled start to Wednesday but rain
OL,14,Fgradually clears for sunny spells and
OL,15,Fa fresher, more autumnal feel. Long
OL,16,Fsunny spells through Thursday but
OL,17,Ffeeling cooler. Turning unsettled on
OL,18,FFriday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
